{"id":"f96ea0698fd88ab2","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-identity.md","title":"Identity","display":"df-identity — Identity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-identity","aliases":["58-df-identity","Identity"],"display":"df-identity — Identity","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-identity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-identity</span><span>Identity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-identity — Identity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}_A\">\\(\\operatorname{Id}_A\\)</span> (本文件定义的恒等关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}identity} \\vdash \\operatorname{Id}_A\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in A\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}identity} \\vdash \\operatorname{Id}_A\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in A\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑等号是原始逻辑符号；本文件定义的是集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上由等号诱导的恒等二元关系。</li>\n<li>Leibniz: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x = y \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\forall P,\\; P(x) \\Leftrightarrow P(y)\">\\(x = y \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\forall P,\\; P(x) \\Leftrightarrow P(y)\\)</span> (Leibniz law)</li>\n<li>Extensionality: sets equal iff they have same elements</li>\n<li>自反、对称、传递与合同是等号的逻辑公理/规则，不再伪装成四个“定义”。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic</li>\n<li>Mendelson, Introduction to Mathematical Logic</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in V$ (集合, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Id}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}identity} \\vdash \\operatorname{Id}_A\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in A\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x = y \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\forall P,\\; P(x) \\Leftrightarrow P(y)","display":false}],"bytes":978,"backlinks":[{"id":"62ea7cd84f64e253","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Id}_X$ (恒等关系, see [[58-df-identity.md]])"},{"id":"0fa54d1179f79de7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Id}_X\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}$ (identity relation, see [[../batch06/58-df-identity.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-658","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-identity.md|58-df-identity]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad"]}